   "section": "1.5",
   "q": "Which call turns `gdp_wide` into `gdp_long`?\n`gdp_wide`:\n```\n# A tibble: 2 × 3\n  country `2019` `2020`\n  <chr>    <dbl>  <dbl>\n1 Chile      279    254\n2 Peru       228    202\n```\n`gdp_long`:\n```\n# A tibble: 4 × 3\n  country year    gdp\n  <chr>   <chr> <dbl>\n1 Chile   2019    279\n2 Chile   2020    254\n3 Peru    2019    228\n4 Peru    2020    202\n```",
