   "q": "`gdp_wide` has the columns `country`, `2019`, `2020`, `2021`. Fill in the blank to stack the three year columns:\n```r\ngdp_wide |>\n  pivot_longer(____, names_to = \"year\", values_to = \"gdp\")\n```",
