   "section": "1.6",
   "q": "`gdp` (billions of US dollars):\n```\n# A tibble: 4 × 3\n  country  year   gdp\n  <chr>   <dbl> <dbl>\n1 Chile    2019   279\n2 Chile    2020   254\n3 Peru     2019   228\n4 Peru     2020   202\n```\n`pop` (millions of people):\n```\n# A tibble: 4 × 3\n  country  year   pop\n  <chr>   <dbl> <dbl>\n1 Chile    2019  18.9\n2 Chile    2020  19.3\n3 Peru     2020  33.3\n4 Bolivia  2020  11.9\n```\nWhich call produces this?\n```\n# A tibble: 4 × 4\n  country  year   gdp   pop\n  <chr>   <dbl> <dbl> <dbl>\n1 Chile    2019   279  18.9\n2 Chile    2020   254  19.3\n3 Peru     2020   202  33.3\n4 Bolivia  2020    NA  11.9\n```",
