   "q": "What is the `yes_pct` column of the result?\n```r\ncounts <- tibble(\n  state = c(\"CA\", \"OR\"),\n  yes = c(30, 10), no = c(70, 30), total = c(100, 40)\n)\ncounts |>\n  mutate(across(c(yes, no), \\(x) 100 * x / total, .names = \"{.col}_pct\"))\n```",
