   "q": "`brfss` has 400 rows and 12 columns, none named `any_ace` or `missing_any`. What are the dimensions of the result?\n```r\nbrfss |>\n  mutate(\n    any_ace = if_any(starts_with(\"ace\"), \\(x) x == 1),\n    missing_any = if_any(starts_with(\"ace\"), is.na)\n  )\n```",
