   "q": "Given `df`:\n```\n# A tibble: 4 × 2\n  g         x\n  <chr> <dbl>\n1 a         1\n2 a        NA\n3 a         3\n4 b         5\n```\nwhat are `n` and `n_obs` in the output row for group `a`?\n```r\ndf |>\n  group_by(g) |>\n  summarize(n = n(), n_obs = sum(!is.na(x)))\n```",
