   "q": "Data frame `pm` has one row per city per year, with columns `city`, `year`, and `pm25`. Take the standard to be 12 µg/m³. What does this code return?\n```r\npm |>\n  filter(pm25 > 12) |>\n  group_by(year) |>\n  summarize(n_exceed = n())\n```",
